1
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,500
(Howard:)Sheldon, you're wrong.

2
00:00:04,671 --> 00:00:06,801
(Howard:)Wolverine was not born
with bone claws.

3
00:00:06,965 --> 00:00:09,215
(Sheldon:)Howard, you know me to be
a very smart man.

4
00:00:09,384 --> 00:00:13,174
(Sheldon:)Don't you think if I were wrong,
I'd know it?

5
00:00:13,638 --> 00:00:15,058
(Howard:)-First of all--
-Give it up.

6
00:00:15,223 --> 00:00:17,853
(Raj:)You're arguing with a crazy person.

7
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:20,858
(Sheldon:)I'm not crazy.
My mother had me tested.

8
00:00:22,397 --> 00:00:24,317
(Leonard:)-Hey, guys.
-What are you doing here?

9
00:00:24,482 --> 00:00:26,112
What? It's new-comic-book night.

10
00:00:26,443 --> 00:00:27,773
Since you and Penny hooked up...

11
00:00:27,944 --> 00:00:31,864
(Raj:)...we thought you two would be having
bouncy naked yum-yum night.

12
00:00:32,699 --> 00:00:34,699
(Leonard:)There's more to life than sex, Raj.

13
00:00:34,868 --> 00:00:36,908
(Howard:)Who had Leonard flames out
in 24 hours?

14
00:00:37,078 --> 00:00:38,748
(Sheldon:)I did.

15
00:00:39,289 --> 00:00:40,499
(Leonard:)Nothing flamed out.

16
00:00:40,665 --> 00:00:42,795
(Leonard:)We don't have to have sex
every night.

17
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:46,459
(Howard:)You don't have to,
but it's highly recommended.

18
00:00:46,629 --> 00:00:48,969
(Raj:)Take advantage
of that window of opportunity...

19
00:00:49,132 --> 00:00:52,222
(Raj:)...before it slams shut
on your little dinky.

20
00:00:52,594 --> 00:00:54,224
(Leonard:)It's not a matter of opportunity.

21
00:00:54,387 --> 00:00:57,227
(Leonard:)We're getting to know each other.
There's a learning curve.

22
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:59,770
What's to learn?
You get naked, do nasty things.

23
00:00:59,934 --> 00:01:03,024
(Howard:)Then somebody makes scrambled eggs
and salami. Easy-peasy.

